  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass7B4B26F9537E4F3C8027DE790061DDEE\"><p>\u200bThe UK launch of <em>Rajput Arms and Armour&#58; The Rathores and their Armoury at Jodhpur Fort </em>by Robert Elgood attracted a sell-out audience last week.&#160;&#160;</p><p>AKU-ISMC\u2019s Dr Stephane Pradines introduced the talk which was followed by a reception and networking.&#160;</p><p>If you did not get the chance to attend the&#160;event, please&#160;click <a href=\"https&#58;//attendee.gotowebinar.com/recording/1194123892781181195\">here</a> to access the recording.</p></div>",
